invalid type: string "Prompt: What does keyscope do in DITA?\n\nAnswer:\n`@keyscope` creates a local key namespace so the same key names can resolve differently in different branches of a map.\n\nIn practice, it lets you reuse a key like `install-guide` more than once without forcing one global definition.\n\nExample\n```xml\n<map>\n  <topicref keyscope='productA'>\n map keeps its own local struct